            "title": "perf: mark lazy event handler factory as side-effect-free",
            "body": "Allow bundlers to remove unused `defineLazyEventHandler()` calls.\n\nRepro bundle sizes with H3 `2.0.8` and Rolldown `1.2.14`:\n\n| Fixture | Measurement | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Unused lazy handler | Minified | 14,140 B | 1,214 B |\n| Unused lazy handler | Gzip | 5,107 B | 714 B |\n\n[Reproduction](https://github.com/onmax/repros/tree/repro/h3-pure-lazy), Node `24.21.0` and pnpm `11.28.5`:\n\n```sh\ngit clone --depth 1 --branch repro/h3-pure-lazy https://github.com/onmax/repros.git h3-repro\ncd h3-repro\nnode verify.mjs\n```\n",
